applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TACHIBANA, IKUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ZUIKO CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>INOUE KIYOFUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TACHIBANA IKUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>INOUE, KIYOFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TACHIBANA, IKUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A heat seal method, comprising the step of passing a plurality of sheets between seal rolls and an opposed roll installed opposedly to the seal rolls, wherein a plurality of seal rolls, in which a seal blade is formed, are provided for one opposed roll so that a same seal part can be sealed multiple times; a heat seal device, comprising a plurality of seal rolls (11 to 13) in which a seal blade is formed and one opposed roll (2) in contact with all of the plurality of seal rolls.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un procédé de thermoscellage, le procédé consistant à faire passer plusieurs feuilles entre des cylindres de scellage et un cylindre opposé se trouvant à l'opposé des cylindres de scellage, plusieurs cylindres de scellage comportant une lame de scellage se trouvant à l'opposé d'un cylindre opposé de sorte qu'une même partie à sceller puisse être scellée plusieurs fois. L'invention concerne également un dispositif de thermoscellage comprenant plusieurs cylindres (11 à 13) de scellage qui comportent une lame de scellage et un cylindre (2) opposé en contact avec tous les cylindres de scellage.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>